[Result ""]
[FEN "3rrbk1/5p1p/p4np1/1pp3B1/1n2P1b1/1B3NN1/PP3PPP/R3R1K1 b - - 0 19"]

{ Black to play. } --   

[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
