[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
[White "1.1) Let’s Just Skip The Warm-Up: Puzzle Set #1"]
[Black "based on Nguyen, Alex Dac-Vuong vs. Baidetskyi, Valentin, Bundesliga 2023"]
