35.Kg3  Rh3+  
36.Kg4  Rg8+  
37.Nxg8  Rxh4+  
38.Kxh4  Ng6+  
39.Kg3  Nxe5  
40.Rxa7 $18  

[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
