44.Qxh6+  Qh7  
45.Qxh7+  Kxh7  
46.Kg3  c2  
47.Kf3  Nc5  
48.Ke2  Nb3  
49.f7  Kg7  
50.g6  c1=Q  
51.Bxc1  Nxc1+  
52.Ke3  Nb3  
53.Ke4  Nc5+  
54.Kxe5  Nd7+  
55.Kf5  Nf8 $10  

[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
[White "2.1) No Pain = No Gain: Puzzle Set #1"]
