42.Kxf7  Rf8+  
43.Kg7  Rg8+  
44.Kf7  Rgf8+ $10  

[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
[White "3.1) Train Insane Or Remain The Same: Puzzle Set #1"]
[Black "Zhai Mo vs. Chen, Yining, Xinghua 2024"]
[Result ""]
