{ White to play. } 
31.--   

[Event "Calculate Like a Beast: The Moranda Method"]
[White "3.3) Train Insane Or Remain The Same: Puzzle Set #3"]
[Black "Kotronias, V. vs. Kapnisis, S., Piraeus 2024"]
